WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.675
Mole rowed carefully on.

2
00:00:18.676 --> 00:00:22.148
Rat leaned forward, listening.

3
00:00:22.149 --> 00:00:25.735
"What's wrong with Rat?" thought Mole.

4
00:00:25.736 --> 00:00:29.350
"He's acting strange."

5
00:00:29.351 --> 00:00:33.820
The river divided into two streams.

6
00:00:33.821 --> 00:00:37.602
"Take the smaller stream," ordered Rat.

7
00:00:37.603 --> 00:00:40.412
Mole steered the boat.

8
00:00:40.413 --> 00:00:45.018
"The music is so clear," said Rat.

9
00:00:45.019 --> 00:00:47.938
"Mole, you must hear it now!"

10
00:00:47.939 --> 00:00:51.684
Suddenly Mole stopped rowing.

11
00:00:51.685 --> 00:00:55.008
The music surrounded him.

12
00:00:55.009 --> 00:00:58.970
"You hear it, Mole!" cried Rat.

13
00:00:58.971 --> 00:01:02.820
"It's magical!" said Mole.

14
00:01:02.821 --> 00:01:06.144
"Row on, Mole!" said Rat.

15
00:01:06.145 --> 00:01:09.537
Mole paddled forward again.

16
00:01:09.538 --> 00:01:14.258
"Look at the grass and the trees," said Rat.

17
00:01:14.259 --> 00:01:18.392
"Everything is glowing!" cried Mole.

18
00:01:18.393 --> 00:01:21.680
"Look at the color of those roses!"

19
00:01:21.681 --> 00:01:26.877
"Smell the wildflowers!" said Rat.

20
00:01:26.878 --> 00:01:30.925
Ahead they saw a small island.

21
00:01:30.926 --> 00:01:34.478
Willows grew all around it.

22
00:01:34.479 --> 00:01:37.735
"Let's tie up here," said Mole.

23
00:01:37.736 --> 00:01:40.340
They got out of the boat.

24
00:01:40.341 --> 00:01:44.628
Rat and Mole pushed through the willows.

25
00:01:44.629 --> 00:01:47.579
"Strange," said Rat.

26
00:01:47.580 --> 00:01:51.401
"I feel happy, but also scared."

27
00:01:51.402 --> 00:01:55.681
"I feel the same way," said Mole.

28
00:01:55.682 --> 00:01:59.980
They stepped into a small, bright clearing.

29
00:01:59.981 --> 00:02:03.021
"Dawn is coming," said Mole.

30
00:02:03.022 --> 00:02:07.452
"Oh, the music stopped," said Rat.

31
00:02:07.453 --> 00:02:13.588
Rat and Mole both looked up.
